DD-S002 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-S002)

  × missing required field `tests` at the top level
   ╭─[04-missing-tests.yaml:3:1]
 2 │ # the tests section is missing
 3 │ spec: driverdesk/0.1
   · ──┬─
   ·   ╰── add `tests:` to the document
 4 │ device:
   ╰────
  help: `tests` is required (spec §16), for example:
        tests:
          - { name: reads_ok, call: <command>, expect: ok }
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[04-missing-tests.yaml:41:1]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 42 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
